    A₀ B C D F v₁ v₂ ε₁ ε₂ χ Ψ m r₁ X Z t Srows label T lengthScale hv hCB hD hΨ hX hZ hSrows hSrows0
    hL hz hud hue huv hkap hmap hT hnorm
