  exact ∑ i, ∑ d ∈ K, if P d i then
    ‖∑ j, ∑ k, if d ∣ left j*right k then originalTerm rows left right a b 1 1 i j k *
      ((Real.sqrt (M/(Ideal.absNorm (rows i):ℝ))/(Ideal.absNorm d:ℝ):ℝ):ℂ) else 0‖ else 0

